{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "${applicationName} screen on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "${applicationName} écran allumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "${applicationName} status": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "État de ${applicationName}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ arms one close. Menu bar and keyboard shortcut arming stay on until you turn KoffeeLid off. Armed + screen on also keeps the display from sleeping.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ active pour une seule fermeture. L’activation depuis la barre des menus ou le raccourci clavier reste jusqu’à ce que vous désactiviez KoffeeLid. Activé + écran allumé empêche aussi l’écran de s’éteindre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d min": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d s": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activation after": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activation après"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activity": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds one line to ~/.zshrc so commands running longer than a few seconds arm KoffeeLid too. Open a new terminal afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajoute une ligne à ~/.zshrc pour que les commandes de plus de quelques secondes activent aussi KoffeeLid. Ouvrez ensuite un nouveau terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages avancés…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All set": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout est prêt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autoriser…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another app or automation put your Mac to sleep while KoffeeLid was armed. Check your charging, scheduling, and automation settings before trying again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une autre app ou automatisation a mis votre Mac en veille alors que KoffeeLid était activé. Vérifiez vos réglages de charge, de programmation et d’automatisation avant de réessayer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve KoffeeLid in System Settings › General › Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisez KoffeeLid dans Réglages Système › Général › Ouverture."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm ${applicationName}": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer ${applicationName}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm KoffeeLid": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer KoffeeLid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm KoffeeLid + screen on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer KoffeeLid + écran allumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm KoffeeLid and keep the display awake indefinitely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active KoffeeLid et garde l’écran allumé indéfiniment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm while you work": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S’activer pendant que vous travaillez"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arm with": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer avec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Armed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Armed + screen on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé + écran allumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Armed + screen on shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raccourci Activé + écran allumé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Armed shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raccourci Activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-arm arms only from Off, never shows in the menu bar and ends on its own once the work is over: half an hour after Claude Code, a minute after a command (Advanced). \"Disarm once finished\" in the menu ends your own arm a minute after the work is over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’activation automatique ne part que depuis Désactivé, n’apparaît jamais dans la barre des menus et s’arrête d’elle-même une fois le travail fini : une demi-heure après Claude Code, une minute après une commande (Avancé). « Désactiver une fois terminé » dans le menu met fin à votre propre activation une minute après la fin du travail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-arm on activity": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activation automatique sur activité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-armed while a command runs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé automatiquement tant qu'une commande tourne"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-armed while Claude Code and a command run": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé automatiquement tant que Claude Code et une commande tournent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-armed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-armed while Claude Code works": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé automatiquement tant que Claude Code travaille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-armed, off in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé automatiquement, fin dans %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-disarm after a command finishes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivation automatique après la fin d'une commande"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-disarm after Claude Code finishes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivation automatique après la fin de Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery dropped to %d%%. The low-battery safety disarmed KoffeeLid so your Mac can sleep instead of running flat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le niveau de batterie est tombé à %d %%. La protection contre la batterie faible a désactivé KoffeeLid afin que votre Mac puisse se mettre en veille au lieu de se décharger complètement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery is at %d%%. Charge the Mac or lower the low-battery threshold.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La batterie est à %d %%. Chargez le Mac ou abaissez le seuil de batterie faible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blip pop": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blip pop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bloop": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bloop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blur strength": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intensité du flou"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annuler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel if reopened by": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annuler si réouvert de"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check for updates…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rechercher des mises à jour…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérification…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chime blip": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Carillon blip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code & agents": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code et agents"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code sessions blocked on a question or a permission do not count as running. A turn whose helpers are still out stays running until they fall silent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une session Claude Code bloquée sur une question ou une permission ne compte pas comme active. Un tour dont les agents auxiliaires tournent encore reste actif jusqu’à ce qu’ils se taisent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close the MacBook and walk away: Claude Code, builds, servers and downloads keep running on a dark, silent display. Open the lid and your Mac locks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rabattez l’écran et partez : Claude Code, vos builds, serveurs et téléchargements continuent sur un écran noir et silencieux. Rouvrez-le et votre Mac se verrouille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not check: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérification impossible : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Crash recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Récupération après plantage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Defaults": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valeurs par défaut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostics log": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Journal de diagnostic"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disarm once finished": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactiver une fois terminé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download and open…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télécharger et ouvrir…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloading…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Téléchargement…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloads": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Téléchargements"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edge softness": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adoucissement des bords"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entrée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fn": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fn (Globe)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fn (Globe)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fn + close lid": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fn + rabattre l’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Force volume for lid-close sound": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Forcer le volume du son de fermeture"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forced volume unmutes and sets the output level only while the sound plays, then restores your volume. Your Mac locks whenever the lid reopens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le volume forcé réactive le son et règle le niveau de sortie uniquement pendant la lecture du son, puis rétablit votre volume. Votre Mac se verrouille chaque fois que vous ouvrez l’écran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Granted": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accordée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold %@ while you start closing the lid. KoffeeLid arms after the activation travel; the plane appears once the lid passes the gesture's start angle (Lid effect below) and follows it from there. If the Globe key triggers its system action when released, set System Settings › Keyboard › \"Press 🌐 key to\" to Do Nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez %@ en commençant à rabattre l’écran. KoffeeLid s’active après la course d’activation ; le plan apparaît dès que l’écran passe sous l’angle de départ du geste (Effet de l’écran, ci-dessous) et le suit ensuite. Si la touche Globe déclenche son action système au relâchement, réglez Réglages Système › Clavier › « Appuyer sur 🌐 pour » sur Ne rien faire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold while closing": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche maintenue en rabattant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hooks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hooks"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ignore commands shorter than": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignorer les commandes plus courtes que"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inner screen zoom": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom de l’écran intérieur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input Monitoring": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Surveillance de l'entrée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep this Mac awake with the lid closed and the built-in display off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder ce Mac éveillé lorsque l’écran est rabattu, avec l’écran intégré éteint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "État de KoffeeLid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid cannot start": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ne peut pas démarrer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not change the Mac's sleep setting. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n’a pas pu modifier le réglage de mise en veille du Mac. Réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not lock the screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n'a pas pu verrouiller l'écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not open the power-management connection it needs. Restart the Mac and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n'a pas pu ouvrir la connexion de gestion de l'alimentation dont il a besoin. Redémarrez le Mac et réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not restore lid sleep before quitting. Restart the Mac to reset it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n'a pas pu rétablir la mise en veille à la fermeture de l'écran avant de quitter. Redémarrez le Mac pour la réinitialiser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not run pmset to allow sleep again. Run `sudo pmset disablesleep 0` in Terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n’a pas pu exécuter pmset pour autoriser à nouveau la veille. Exécutez `sudo pmset disablesleep 0` dans le Terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid could not verify the display setup. Disconnect any additional displays and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid n’a pas pu vérifier la configuration des écrans. Déconnectez tous les écrans supplémentaires, puis réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid did not arm": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ne s'est pas activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid did not arm because macOS reports high thermal pressure. Let the Mac cool, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ne s’est pas activé, car macOS signale une pression thermique élevée. Laissez le Mac refroidir, puis réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid did not arm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid ne s'est pas activé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid disarmed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid désactivé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid held your Mac awake": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid a maintenu votre Mac éveillé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid is retrying. Until the warning icon clears, open the lid before leaving your Mac; restarting the Mac always resets this setting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid retente l’opération. Tant que l’icône d’avertissement reste affichée, ouvrez l’écran avant de laisser votre Mac sans surveillance. Le redémarrage du Mac réinitialise toujours ce réglage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid is still starting. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid est encore en train de démarrer. Réessayez dans un instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KoffeeLid needs a few things from macOS. Items marked with a warning are required for a closed Mac to stay awake safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KoffeeLid a besoin de quelques réglages de macOS. Les éléments marqués d’un avertissement sont indispensables pour qu’un Mac fermé reste éveillé en toute sécurité."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir à la connexion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let this Mac sleep normally when the lid closes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisser ce Mac se mettre normalement en veille lorsque l’écran est rabattu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets KoffeeLid read the built-in keyboard's Fn key directly, so only that key arms the lid gesture and an external keyboard's Fn key does not.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à KoffeeLid de lire directement la touche Fn du clavier intégré : seule cette touche arme le geste du capot, pas celle d'un clavier externe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets the lid effect show your desktop folding as the lid closes.": {
      "localizations": {
